# A result field whose value is a disjunction, reached through a helper: one of several values, not a value (testdata/known/lens-result-depends-on-other-lens, #20).
-- source.cue --
a: string
-- target.cue --
b: string
-- lens.cue --
_h: *"default" | string
input: _
result: {b: _h}
-- out --
not total
result.b is *"default" | string, a disjunction rather than a value; a result field must have one concrete value (rule not-a-value) @ lens.cue:3:13
